      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At Home Relocation Timeline Ranchi, we believe that a stress‑free move starts with a clear, honest pricing structure. Our commitment to transparency is built around four core pillars that keep every client informed and confident from the first quote to the final delivery.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
